{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-haus-of-tenet","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"haus-of-tenet-irth-development-business-bay","about":"Haus of Tenet by IRTH is a branded, art-led commercial development that represents a clear shift in how office ownership is positioned in Dubai. The project is conceived as a long-term institutional address rather than a conventional commercial building. Every aspect of the development is shaped around authorship, permanence, and cultural value, making it particularly relevant for founders, family offices, and leadership-led enterprises.Located in Business Bay, the project introduces an integrated art ecosystem that goes beyond aesthetics. A curated in-house gallery, annual art auctions, and a shared art ownership program are embedded into the building’s common spaces, with the initial investment fully borne by the developer. Offices are delivered in shell-and-core condition and organized through a semi-private cluster model, allowing owners to expand over time without relocating. This deliberate combination of architecture, art, and ownership structure positions Haus of Tenet in Business Bay as a differentiated commercial asset built for long-term relevance.","price":null,"title":"Haus Of Tenet","bitrix":{"id":1425,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Haus Of Tenet","property_type":"Offices","developer_name":"IRTH Development","project_location":"Business Bay"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Feature_ab429c889a.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Feature_ab429c889a.webp"}],"status":null,"_geoloc":{"lat":25.178327528019,"lng":55.269406271959},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_7_5cfce65999.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Gallery_7_5cfce659